  <Tagline>k__BackingField: 'The Mega Edition''s red die: bus rides and Mr. Monopoly.'
  <Description>k__BackingField: Once you have passed GO, the red speed die rolls too. 1 to 3 add to your move. Mr. Monopoly moves you on to the next property for sale (or the next rent you owe). The bus lets you move by either die or both. Triples move you anywhere you like!
